1, "title": "", "_data": [], "type": "audio", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn8le10ob07re2img01.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn8le10ob07re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn8le10ob07re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn8le10ob07re2img01.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: This is so nice of you to show me how to cook that simple spicy rice dish. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I want to keep that one in mind for a bit.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: You should make up little recipe booklets for the restaurant.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: They could be put out to sell at our next Spicy Rice Night! <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: You should give me a couple to take to the office.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: They could be sent as a thank you to Ms. Ryan.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I can pass them along."}, {"time": "21500", "image": "engenn8le10ob07re2img02.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: That was brilliant of you Sally explaining to Ms. Ryan how everything could be fixed! That was really quick thinking on your part. It helped make the evening even more profitable! I even got a standing reservation from one of her crew.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: You should hire me to do some PR. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Okay stop gesturing with the knife. I don't want to be stabbed!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Sorry. I can't be trusted sometimes!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Cut the onions while I start the rice."}, {"time": "47500", "image": "engenn8le10ob07re2img05.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Ow! <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: What happened?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I dropped this huge onion on my toe. It's throbbing! <br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Be more careful especially when we start cooking. You don't want to burn or scald yourself. By the way, you should cut away from yourself. You don't want to cut your fingers.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I find that hard. Hey, why is the onion all red?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Ummm. You're bleeding."}]}}]}]}], "type": "sena"}